===Etymology===
From {{m|ta|நல்||good}},<ref name="Fabricius"/><ref>{{R:TAL}}</ref> from {{der|ta|dra-sou-pro|*nal||good}}. Compare {{m|ta|நன்று}}.

Cognate with {{cog|kn|ನನ್ನಿ}}, {{cog|ml|നന്ദി}} / {{m|ml|നന്നി}}.

